WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:05.231
After approval, sign in with your own username or email and password.

5
00:00:05.231 --> 00:00:11.164
This recording uses fictional records, simulated email, location and a test camera.

9
00:00:11.164 --> 00:00:12.879
No live work is created.

13
00:00:13.679 --> 00:00:18.490
The overview shows worker-started activity and the company review queue.

17
00:00:18.490 --> 00:00:20.829
You do not need to assign each job.

21
00:00:20.829 --> 00:00:26.978
Visit the app periodically, or use the configured daily summary to identify pending reviews.

25
00:00:27.778 --> 00:00:29.968
Manage your own workers in My team.

29
00:00:29.968 --> 00:00:33.536
Invite one worker by email and share the single-use link.

33
00:00:33.536 --> 00:00:35.915
The worker chooses their own password.

37
00:00:35.915 --> 00:00:40.109
After email verification, use Pending approvals to activate access.

41
00:00:40.109 --> 00:00:43.363
Company administrators cannot view worker passwords.

45
00:00:44.163 --> 00:00:46.171
Open a submitted work record.

49
00:00:46.171 --> 00:00:52.333
Review the crew, each line and sub-line item, measured snow depth and service quantities.

53
00:00:52.333 --> 00:00:56.487
Compare original attendance with the worker’s claimed hours.

57
00:00:57.287 --> 00:01:00.720
Open before and after photos in the private gallery.

61
00:01:00.720 --> 00:01:04.021
Check ruler evidence against the confirmed inches.

65
00:01:04.021 --> 00:01:08.972
Review location links and resolve reported issues with a clear explanation.

69
00:01:09.772 --> 00:01:13.547
Approve only after checking the services, hours and evidence.

73
00:01:13.547 --> 00:01:17.818
Acknowledge the below-two-inch flag after inspecting the ruler photo.

77
00:01:17.818 --> 00:01:21.841
Forward the record to NPI, or request a correction with a reason.

81
00:01:21.841 --> 00:01:24.998
Company approval does not replace NPI verification.

85
00:01:25.798 --> 00:01:30.865
Open Reports, choose the dates and filters, and generate a snapshot.

89
00:01:30.865 --> 00:01:34.665
CSV and Excel include all matching company records.

93
00:01:34.665 --> 00:01:36.677
PDF is a printable summary.

97
00:01:36.677 --> 00:01:39.956
Other companies are excluded by the backend.

101
00:01:40.756 --> 00:01:43.861
Set your company’s recipient emails in Settings.

105
00:01:43.861 --> 00:01:48.067
Daily summaries are off by default; enable them only when wanted.

109
00:01:48.067 --> 00:01:52.532
Immediate issue alerts and queued email status remain available here.

113
00:01:52.532 --> 00:01:56.156
A verified sender and scheduled dispatcher are required.
